# chatCope(Player player, Int delta)
# Engine-unfavorable swing handler. Triggered from engineMove when
# curEngineScore - prevEngineScore <= -200 (in centipawns, after the
# mate-score gate), meaning the engine's eval dropped between turns
# — usually because the engine's last move turned out worse than
# expected, or the human played a strong response.
#
# delta is negative on this path (engine's perspective). Body is a
# TEST PLACEHOLDER. Replace with the real message bank — keep the
# (player, delta) signature so the trigger in engineMove doesn't
# need to change.

@using rychess
@fast

@player &7<&crychess&7>&r &b[COPE TEST]&r engine-unfavorable swing detected, delta={{delta}} cp
